---
description: Mandatory telemetry isolation from auth, payments, reconciliation and access
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing or reviewing telemetry, analytics adapters, Mixpanel/GA4/Intercom
product emits, Sentry feedback, or identity enrichment for analytics, read and
follow `telemetry/isolation.md` in this repository and the monorepo root
`AGENTS.md` optional-integration hard rule.

Telemetry (including enrichment/prep) must not block essential Ana M ops.
`catch` is not isolation if the critical path still waits. Best-effort is not
guaranteed delivery. Analytics absence must not remove financial or audit
records. Related changes require failure-path tests that preserve auth, payment,
reconciliation and access outcomes.
